      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town began as Strawberry Valley, later Berryvale, and was renamed Sisson after businessman Justin Hinckley Sisson who donated land for the railroad station in 1886.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3,
        17,
        18
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
